{"id":"df08310d02ee0072","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-hyperimmune-free.md","title":"超免疫与超免疫自由","display":"df-hyperimmune-free — 超免疫与超免疫自由","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","aliases":["43-df-hyperimmune-free"],"display":"df-hyperimmune-free — 超免疫与超免疫自由","depends_on":["[[43-df-domination]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Definition 5.14.1, print p.57 / PDF p.77","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-hyperimmune-free"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-hyperimmune-free</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyperimmune-free — 超免疫与超免疫自由"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5366face87e76fb\" href=\"?note=d5366face87e76fb\" title=\"43-df-domination\">43-df-domination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 5.14.1, print p.57 / PDF p.77"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>；所量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 均总定义。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\le_TA\\ \\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\Rightarrow f\\not\\le^*g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\le_TA\\ \\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\Rightarrow f\\not\\le^*g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\le_TA\\ \\exists g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\land f\\le^*g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\le_TA\\ \\exists g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\land f\\le^*g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>性质由Turing度决定。取逐点控制替换最终支配给出等价定义，不要求统一地从f的编号求出g。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Definition 5.14.1, print p.57 / PDF p.77。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"d5366face87e76fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal O$；所量化 $f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 均总定义。 $\\mathcal O$、$\\operatorname{AsSet}$、$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSequence}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\le_TA\\ \\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\Rightarrow f\\not\\le^*g).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\le_TA\\ \\exists g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\land f\\le^*g).","display":true}],"bytes":1457,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]] — 超免疫与超免疫自由"},{"id":"47e0fc3d4fc32c3c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-ce-traceable]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]、[[43-df-computably-traceable]]。"},{"id":"21a834c868e3b41d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"5e1e6346289285ce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]。"},{"id":"0e25902f9c93ca41","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(X)$，见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]。$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$、$\\mathrm{Weak2Random}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-weak2random]]；有效开集与测度见 [[43-df-effective-open]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"0c9aef3f96f3e90f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{deg}$ 是 [[43-df-dstr]] 的Turing度映射；$\\mathrm{HyperimmuneFree}$ 见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$ 见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]。所有集合均属于 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$。"},{"id":"84509a9312e5b529","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]] 的度性质；$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-set]] 的集合性质，$\\equiv_T$ 采用 [[43-df-turing-red]]。"},{"id":"f9011be22ddebf75","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)$ 指 B 的度计算不可支配函数，见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]；$\\equiv_T$、$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\\dim_{SP}$ 见 [[43-df-turi